				<description>&lt;script type=&#34;application/ld+json&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;{&#xD;&#xA;  &#34;@context&#34;: &#34;https://schema.org&#34;,&#xD;&#xA;  &#34;@type&#34;: &#34;Person&#34;,&#xD;&#xA;  &#34;name&#34;: &#34;Anna Pivtorak (Kostyuk)&#34;,&#xD;&#xA;  &#34;url&#34;: &#34;https://pivtorak.studio/en/docs/about/&#34;,&#xD;&#xA;  &#34;mainEntityOfPage&#34;: &#34;https://pivtorak.studio/en/docs/about/&#34;,&#xD;&#xA;  &#34;description&#34;: &#34;Anna Pivtorak (Kostyuk) is a Ukrainian researcher, author of cultural projects, and founder of Pivtorak.Studio, specializing in the architecture of values and identity formation.&#34;,&#xD;&#xA;  &#34;sameAs&#34;: [&#xD;&#xA;    &#34;https://pivtorak.studio&#34;,&#xD;&#xA;    &#34;https://www.instagram.com/pivtorak.studio/&#34;,&#xD;&#xA;    &#34;https://memoryon.net/s/eOKTKuOc9l&#34;&#xD;&#xA;  ]&#xD;&#xA;}&#xD;&#xA;&lt;/script&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;float-right&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/anna-pivtorak-kostyuk-identity.webp&#34; alt=&#34;Anna Pivtorak (Kostyuk) — Official Page&#34; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;anna-pivtorak-kostyuk&#34;&gt;Anna Pivtorak (Kostyuk)&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#anna-pivtorak-kostyuk&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I am a researcher and creator of cultural projects focused on the intersection of analytical inquiry and creative expression. My work centers on the formation of long-term value structures and the preservation of intellectual heritage.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
